{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/queueing-theory/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"queueing-elements","title":"排队系统要素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/queueing-theory/foundations/queueing-elements","wordCount":1582,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"kendall-notation","title":"Kendall 记号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/queueing-theory/foundations/kendall-notation","wordCount":1293,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"littles-law","title":"Little 定律","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/queueing-theory/foundations/littles-law","wordCount":1414,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础\">基础</h1><p>任何排队模型动手算之前，你得先把现实场景翻译成三样东西：请求按什么规律到来、每个请求要服务多久、队伍按什么规则放行。这一章就是教你做这件翻译，并交给你两件贯穿全 hub 的工具。</p>\n<p>「排队系统要素」拆解到达过程、服务过程、服务台数量、容量上限与排队纪律，定义利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>、队长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、逗留时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 这些后面每一篇都要用的量，是整个 hub 的术语字典。「Kendall 记号」把这些要素压成 <code>A/B/c/K/N/D</code> 的标准标签——读懂它，你就能在一秒内判断一个模型属于哪一类、能不能闭式求解。「Little 定律」给出全 hub 唯一一条不挑分布的普适等式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L=\\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span>：它对 M/M/1 成立，对最复杂的网络也成立，是你验算和估算时最先抓的那根绳子。</p>\n<p>这一章是后续三章的地基。建议先通读本章再进入经典模型——记号一章会反复在模型命名里出现，Little 定律会在每个模型的指标推导里被默默调用。本章只需要指数与泊松分布的直觉，更深的随机过程机理留给到达过程被首次提及时再链接过去。</p>\n"}